[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    235[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     // A C `enum` accepts any int, and the ABI leaves bits 8..31 of a `char`
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    236[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     // argument unspecified; a caller with no prototype (or a hand-written FFI
